      ('sharing_perimeter'::text, null::text, '{"project_kind":"it_autoconsumatore_a_distanza"}'::jsonb, '["same_substation"]'::jsonb, 'list'::text, '2024-01-24'::date, null::date, 'it_camera_autoconsumo_diffuso'::text, 'The incentive of the decree 414/2023 is paid only on the energy shared by plants and consumption points connected under the same primary substation (cabina primaria); the energy may be shared within one market zone (Decreto legislativo 199/2021, article 31, as amended by the decree-law 19/2025, article 1-bis), which no criterion of the model holds: the perimeter loaded is the one of the shared energy the incentive and the TIAD value. The primary substation is a grid.substations row, the meter says which one it is downstream of, read on the energy services manager''s maps'::text, 'published'::text),
